- branch: fix/cli-373-bump-build-postcondition
- scope-decision:
  - right-thing: Add runBuild(runCmd) helper + call it from main() tail after writeReadmeVersion. Cures the dist/ staleness class per cli#373 + Session H architect-review.
  - simplest: Dependency-injected runner mirrors the refuseIfDirty(allowDirty, runCmd) idiom on line 111 — one new function, one call site.
  - brute-force? No. Hypothesis cited inline: adding build to the postcondition cures the dist/ version-mismatch class. Falsifiable test ships in the same PR.
